{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation and validation evidence. Mapping: the three filter-negotiation/missing-object cases, both identity lanes, and reconvergence/push are size-independent and now use an isolated 1 KiB historical-object server; the workflow-absence test uses no server; only standalone full-versus-blobless pack guards retain the 141 MiB server, and their xdist group confines that build to one worker. Happy RED was the missing small_ticket_server fixture. Full held-out GREEN was 7 cases in 4.01s, including direct/named protocol paths, a full-fetch control, both identity lanes, and reconvergence/push; the implementer saw only the named-origin happy path and needed two attempts, with the second removing an unused large-fixture dependency found by runtime validation. Exact-defect mutation replaced the small payload with 141 MiB: the held-out pack oracle failed at 144432 KiB versus the 1024 KiB ceiling, then passed after restoration. CI-shaped macOS comparison, three workers with loadgroup: baseline 9 passed, pytest wall 78.85s, process real 113.08s, three large setups totaling about 99.99s, user plus sys 145.27s; final 10 passed, pytest wall 24.06s, process real 24.28s, large plus small setups totaling 14.78s, user plus sys 27.90s. Savings: pytest wall 69.5%, real wall 78.5%, setup 85.2%, aggregate CPU 80.8%. Each worker owns separate temporary repositories, object databases, ephemeral loopback port, daemon, and teardown; no mutable server is shared. The retained guards still use real Git protocol and the incompressible larger-than-140-MiB contrast; no mock replaces protocol behavior. Gates: held-out suite green; mutation had teeth; CI-shaped full file 10 passed; make lint green; make typecheck green; make test green with 13518 passed, 60 skipped, 289 deselected, 20 warnings in 4290.79s."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786881001096497001,"uuid":"c5917c51-d6b9-4568-889a-92f79016904a"}